{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve the problem, we need to find a value for \\( x \\) such that \\( f^{-1}(x) = f(x+1) \\) given the function \\( f(x) = 5x - 12 \\).\n\n### Step 1: Find the inverse function \\( f^{-1}(x) \\)\nFirst, we need to find the inverse function \\( f^{-1}(x) \\). Start by setting \\( y = f(x) \\):\n\\[ y = 5x - 12 \\]\n\nNext, solve for \\( x \\) in terms of \\( y \\):\n\\[ y + 12 = 5x \\]\n\\[ x = \\frac{y + 12}{5} \\]\n\nThus, the inverse function is:\n\\[ f^{-1}(x) = \\frac{x + 12}{5} \\]\n\n### Step 2: Substitute \\( f(x+1) \\) into the function\nNext, we need to find \\( f(x+1) \\):\n\\[ f(x+1) = 5(x+1) - 12 \\]\n\\[ f(x+1) = 5x + 5 - 12 \\]\n\\[ f(x+1) = 5x - 7 \\]\n\n","prefix_end":627,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,279,3491,11,582,1184,311,1477,264,897,369,17767,856,1124,8,1741,429,17767,282,87210,16,25547,87,8,284,282,2075,10,16,8,1124,8,2661,279,729,17767,282,2075,8,284,220,20,87,481,220,16,17,1124,3593,14374,14822,220,16,25,7379,279,27949,729,17767,282,87210,16,25547,87,8,1124,340,5338,11,582,1184,311,1477,279,27949,729,17767,282,87210,16,25547,87,8,1124,568,5145,553,6243,17767,379,284,282,2075,8,1124,982,78045,379,284,220,20,87,481,220,16,17,1124,2533,5847,11,11625,369,17767,856,1124,8,304,3793,315,17767,379,1124,982,78045,379,488,220,16,17,284,220,20,87,1124,921,78045,856,284,1124,37018,90,88,488,220,16,17,15170,20,92,1124,2533,44500,11,279,27949,729,374,510,78045,282,87210,16,25547,87,8,284,1124,37018,45340,488,220,16,17,15170,20,92,1124,2533,14374,14822,220,17,25,87149,17767,282,2075,10,16,8,1124,8,1119,279,729,198,5847,11,582,1184,311,1477,17767,282,2075,10,16,8,1124,982,78045,282,2075,10,16,8,284,220,20,2075,10,16,8,481,220,16,17,1124,921,78045,282,2075,10,16,8,284,220,20,87,488,220,20,481,220,16,17,1124,921,78045,282,2075,10,16,8,284,220,20,87,481,220,22,1124,2533,14374,14822,220,